 "remarks": "Ideally situated just one mile from downtown Stamford and minutes from the Glenbrook train station, this home offers easy access to commuting, shopping, dining, and everyday conveniences. With two CVS locations, two grocery stores, countless locally owned shops and restaurants, all nearby, everything you need is right at your fingertips. Set back from the street, the property offers a welcome sense of privacy, along with one assigned off-street parking space and an additional guest parking space. Inside, you'll find generously sized bedrooms, large closets, and a bonus finished basement offering valuable additional living space, complete with laundry and storage. Step outside to enjoy your own private deck or relax in the shared outdoor space. Whether you're looking for room to spread out, a convenient location, or the charm of a smaller residential community, this townhouse offers the best of Stamford living. Enjoy the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and community in this spacious two-bedroom, 1.5-bath townhouse located in a small condo community in Stamford.",
